# Leftovers of a hard-killed `nasdaq-agent record` (nasdaq_agent/replay/recording.py). A recording
# stages beside the cassette directory as .<cassette>.recording-<run id> (plus a .previous backup if
# it died mid-swap) and holds the lock .<cassette>.lock; with the default AGENT_CASSETTE_DIR these are
# fixtures/.cassettes.recording-... and fixtures/.cassettes.lock. A staging directory has not been
# secret-scanned, so it must never be committed.
.*.recording-[0-9]*T[0-9]*Z-[0-9a-f]*
fixtures/.*.lock
# Local design material, not published: the spec, the plan, the decisions log and the diagram sources.
